WEBVTT

00:35.360 --> 00:36.480
Attack!

00:39.240 --> 00:42.120
Show them the mighty power
of the royal knights!

00:54.120 --> 00:55.600
Off they go!

00:55.680 --> 00:59.280
The magic knights of the Kingdom
versus the beastmen of the Empire!

00:59.880 --> 01:02.800
Which side has the advantage?
Over to our commentator, Mr. Deadshot.

01:02.880 --> 01:06.240
Evenly matched in troop numbers,
but one side is trying to siege a castle.

01:06.320 --> 01:08.680
The outcome is painfully obvious.

01:09.640 --> 01:11.800
Oh really? How can you tell?

01:11.880 --> 01:15.360
Back in the army, my dickhead
of a commander always told us:

01:15.880 --> 01:17.680
"Never charge the enemy straight on.

01:18.280 --> 01:20.800
Unless you have an ass for a head."

01:23.920 --> 01:26.480
The Imperial forces'
leadership is extraordinary.

01:27.080 --> 01:29.120
Don't fall back! Keep charging!

01:29.200 --> 01:30.880
They're like
a modern special forces unit.

01:30.960 --> 01:32.800
Even though they're just beasts.

01:35.000 --> 01:36.240
Hey, nutjob!

01:36.320 --> 01:37.720
How much time we got left?

01:37.800 --> 01:39.840
Two, one...

01:39.920 --> 01:42.240
Exactly 30 hours as of right now.

01:42.920 --> 01:46.080
That's not enough time to formulate
a decent plan of attack.

01:46.160 --> 01:50.080
Which sucks, because
they've clearly got a top-notch commander.

01:51.520 --> 01:53.320
Brainless schmucks.

01:54.120 --> 01:58.240
Did they really think this would be enough
to wipe out my lovely beasts?

03:33.080 --> 03:34.600
<i>What on earth...?</i>

03:49.600 --> 03:50.760
<i>The army's here!</i>

03:50.840 --> 03:52.960
<i>That's the flag of the royal forces!</i>

03:54.680 --> 03:56.160
<i>What do you morons think you're doing?!</i>

03:56.240 --> 03:57.240
Huh?

03:58.040 --> 04:01.800
Hmm? If I'm not mistaken, isn't that
the same knight who captured us?

04:05.920 --> 04:08.800
That guy who looks like
a stressed out insurance salesman!

04:09.440 --> 04:12.200
<i>This is clear rebellion</i>
<i>against the Kingdom!</i>

04:12.280 --> 04:13.320
Say what?

04:13.400 --> 04:15.440
"Quit stressing me out any more!

04:15.520 --> 04:17.880
I don't want to lose
all my precious hair!"

04:20.520 --> 04:23.120
<i>Did you say something to insult me?</i>

04:29.680 --> 04:30.680
<i>Huh?</i>

04:31.720 --> 04:32.720
<i>Come, my sword!</i>

04:35.360 --> 04:36.360
Nana!

04:43.760 --> 04:44.840
<i>What!?</i>

04:44.920 --> 04:46.760
Huh? You want a piece of us, jackass?!

04:46.840 --> 04:48.840
No, wait! Hold on!

04:50.120 --> 04:52.520
Let me handle this. I have an idea.

04:52.600 --> 04:55.760
Nanaue, you want to
eat better food, right?

04:56.720 --> 04:59.000
Screw that! I never back down from...

04:59.080 --> 05:01.520
Start a fight now and
we'll have the knights on our ass

05:01.600 --> 05:03.160
all the way from here to the Gate.

05:03.240 --> 05:04.920
That'll eat up time you don't have.

05:06.040 --> 05:07.400
Just let me handle this.

05:08.720 --> 05:09.720
Tsk!

05:11.320 --> 05:13.960
<i>-Hey, hear me out.</i>
<i>-Huh?</i>

05:15.040 --> 05:16.320
You speak their language?!

05:16.880 --> 05:19.520
Just a little bit that I picked up
from the other inmates.

05:19.600 --> 05:21.360
I've been here longer than any of you.

05:23.680 --> 05:26.400
<i>Let's make a deal.</i>
<i>Get your ugly ass over here.</i>

05:26.480 --> 05:27.840
<i>What?</i>

05:27.920 --> 05:32.160
<i>We don't want to fight you.</i>
<i>So lead us to where your damn boss is.</i>

05:32.240 --> 05:34.280
<i>We want to talk. Talk, got it?</i>

05:34.360 --> 05:37.240
<i>Does your dumb stank-ass understand</i>
<i>the words I'm saying?</i>

05:38.400 --> 05:39.600
<i>Not a chance!</i>

05:40.160 --> 05:41.200
<i>Go back to your cells!</i>

05:41.280 --> 05:43.640
<i>Quit wasting my goddamn time.</i>

05:43.720 --> 05:44.720
Er...

05:44.800 --> 05:46.040
<i>We want to talk.</i>

05:46.120 --> 05:49.480
<i>Or does your dumb stank-ass</i>
<i>still not understand me?</i>

05:49.560 --> 05:52.040
Hey, you sure
you're getting through to him?

05:52.120 --> 05:55.120
-Huh?
-Because he's looking increasingly upset.

05:55.200 --> 05:57.560
Is it wise to communicate
with words you learned from orcs?

05:57.640 --> 06:00.200
Well... I'm pretty sure it's fine...

06:02.240 --> 06:05.200
<i>-Does your dumb stank-ass still not...</i>
<i>-Enough of your insults!</i>

06:06.080 --> 06:08.560
<i>Could we talk to that girl</i>
<i>and her group?</i>

06:08.640 --> 06:10.800
<i>I wish to help in my own way.</i>

06:11.520 --> 06:14.680
<i>So that we can end the fighting</i>
<i>as quickly as possible.</i>

06:19.760 --> 06:21.040
<i>C-Commander!</i>

06:23.120 --> 06:24.240
<i>Follow me.</i>

06:25.360 --> 06:27.040
<i>That's more like it, chickenshit.</i>

06:35.920 --> 06:38.200
-Hey watch it!
-Quit pushing!

06:40.640 --> 06:42.640
Ouch!

06:42.720 --> 06:45.360
How about treating a lady
with a little more respe...

06:51.520 --> 06:55.400
This is like a scene straight out of
the movies that I've seen a million times.

06:55.480 --> 06:58.360
Doesn't seem like we're hugely welcome.

06:58.440 --> 07:00.120
Guess we're still in the doghouse.

07:04.840 --> 07:06.720
<i>What is with that demi-human?</i>

07:06.800 --> 07:09.320
<i>Are these really the people</i>
<i>who won that last battle?</i>

07:11.520 --> 07:13.120
<i>Her Majesty will see you now.</i>

07:13.200 --> 07:15.160
<i>Mind your language.</i>

07:38.160 --> 07:40.560
<i>-These are the ones?</i>
<i>-Yes.</i>

07:41.080 --> 07:43.320
Who's the lady? A queen consort?

07:43.400 --> 07:45.000
That's got to be the Queen.

07:45.080 --> 07:46.960
Just look at her huge-ass throne.

07:47.040 --> 07:48.720
And that high and mighty attitude.

07:56.080 --> 07:58.040
What? What did you just say?

07:58.120 --> 07:59.640
Whoa! I can understand her.

07:59.720 --> 08:01.840
Must be my genius brain at work!

08:01.920 --> 08:04.760
No, it's magic! She cast a spell
so we understand each other!

08:05.320 --> 08:06.960
Talk about convenient!

08:09.160 --> 08:10.160
Your Majesty.

08:10.760 --> 08:13.320
We humbly appreciate
you granting us an audience.

08:13.400 --> 08:15.560
There is an urgent request to make,

08:15.640 --> 08:17.360
which is why we sought to meet with you.

08:18.360 --> 08:20.200
So you do know how to speak properly.

08:21.120 --> 08:22.800
You are my prisoners.

08:22.880 --> 08:24.760
What right do you have to make requests?

08:24.840 --> 08:27.080
Exactly. Know your place.

08:27.160 --> 08:30.600
It's a miracle that riffraff like you
were even allowed into the castle.

08:31.320 --> 08:33.720
I sincerely apologize
for our insolence in the prison.

08:33.800 --> 08:37.440
But we have information
that may prove useful to Your Majesty.

08:37.520 --> 08:41.160
All we ask in return
is your permission for us to move freely.

08:43.640 --> 08:47.320
You must have noticed that the Empire
has grown stronger during this war.

08:47.400 --> 08:51.640
Did you know it's because
they replaced all their senior officers?

08:53.080 --> 08:56.320
We already caught wind of that long ago.
If that's all you have to...

08:56.400 --> 08:57.800
Very well, but are you aware

08:57.880 --> 09:01.320
that all those newly installed officers
are from another word like us?

09:04.160 --> 09:05.600
Another world?

09:05.680 --> 09:07.240
What other world?

09:07.320 --> 09:09.720
Trust me when I say
they are extremely dangerous.

09:09.800 --> 09:10.920
But I have information about...

09:11.000 --> 09:14.600
Oh, duh! That makes sense!
Now I see the big picture.

09:15.280 --> 09:17.840
If they were going to send
others before us,

09:17.920 --> 09:20.880
it sure as hell wasn't
a team of legit soldiers, was it?

09:20.960 --> 09:23.640
-Keep your mouth shut.
-That figures.

09:23.720 --> 09:25.760
The group you brought in the beginning

09:25.840 --> 09:28.360
was also another suicide squad, huh?

09:28.440 --> 09:30.040
I guess you lost control of them,

09:30.120 --> 09:33.880
and they ditched you for the Empire
and are having a grand ol' time.

09:33.960 --> 09:35.920
Hmm. I hate to put it this way, but...

09:36.000 --> 09:40.280
So the rise of the Empire
was due to your incompetence?

09:42.640 --> 09:44.440
Wow! What a familiar twist!

09:44.520 --> 09:46.560
I do love it when things go south.

09:49.280 --> 09:50.600
Queen of this world!

09:51.520 --> 09:55.360
We're willing to do what it takes
to atone for that mistake.

09:55.440 --> 09:57.200
Name any battlefield you wish.

09:57.880 --> 10:02.000
We'll go out there, fight, and bring peace
to your lands in the blink of an eye.

10:02.520 --> 10:04.200
Who said you get to decide?!

10:06.880 --> 10:09.600
I trust you're willing to make good
on this man's words?

10:11.000 --> 10:12.000
Yes, Your Majesty.

10:16.400 --> 10:18.040
Then prove it to me.

10:18.120 --> 10:20.480
Otherwise, this man loses his head.

10:20.560 --> 10:22.120
But Your Majesty!

10:22.200 --> 10:23.720
Having them fight in our battle...

10:23.800 --> 10:26.560
You were the one
who brought them before me.

10:26.640 --> 10:28.720
We wouldn't be in this situation
in the first place,

10:28.800 --> 10:30.880
if your knights had held firm.

10:30.960 --> 10:32.240
Am I wrong?

10:33.920 --> 10:37.160
-Bye-bye!
-He got what's coming to him.

10:37.240 --> 10:38.960
D-dammit! Hey, you guys!

10:39.040 --> 10:40.760
-Bleh!
-You better get the job done!

10:40.840 --> 10:43.960
-Hmm...
-Don't ignore me!

10:44.040 --> 10:45.720
You know what's at stake, right?!

10:46.640 --> 10:48.960
Quit acting like you run the show.

10:49.040 --> 10:52.280
I'm not going to
bust my ass for this crap.

10:52.360 --> 10:56.200
Don't forget! I'm the only one who knows
where the Gate is!

10:56.280 --> 10:59.320
Your heads are going to blow up!
Don't you dare forget!

11:01.080 --> 11:02.080
So what now?

11:02.160 --> 11:05.560
Hmm. For starters,
I'm hungry and want to eat.

11:05.640 --> 11:06.840
Something really tasty!

11:07.400 --> 11:09.440
We promised Nana good food, too.

11:09.520 --> 11:10.520
Oh, and...

11:11.040 --> 11:13.120
I need you to return our stuff, okay?

11:35.560 --> 11:39.080
So, you're... still going to wear a mask?

11:39.160 --> 11:41.880
Revealing my face
could prove detrimental to the mission.

11:43.120 --> 11:44.200
By the way...

11:50.880 --> 11:52.360
You're really going to wear that?

11:58.640 --> 12:00.280
Okay. You do you.

12:08.480 --> 12:10.000
Alrighty. Shall we?

12:30.760 --> 12:32.160
Should we back them up?

12:33.040 --> 12:34.440
No frigging point.

12:34.520 --> 12:36.160
You heard that hot shot commander...

12:36.240 --> 12:39.560
Stay out of this!
Our royal forces will do the fighting.

12:40.440 --> 12:42.120
We don't take help from outsiders!

12:44.520 --> 12:45.920
<i>He sidelined us.</i>

12:47.280 --> 12:49.440
We wouldn't want to hurt his pride.

12:49.520 --> 12:50.520
Hmm.

12:50.600 --> 12:52.360
But helping them in spite of that

12:52.440 --> 12:54.440
could lead to them
seeing us in a better light.

12:54.520 --> 12:56.720
Also a fairly common trope in the movies.

12:57.920 --> 13:02.160
Useless allies are better off dead.
They get in the way of the mission.

13:02.680 --> 13:04.280
If I'm being honest,

13:04.360 --> 13:06.960
taking those things on
would be a pain in the ass.

13:16.160 --> 13:17.680
<i>They act like kamikaze  fighters.</i>

13:17.760 --> 13:20.560
Christ. I can only imagine
how they were trained.

13:20.640 --> 13:21.720
-Trained?
-Hmm?

13:22.480 --> 13:25.120
-It's more like brainwashing.
-Hmm?

13:25.760 --> 13:27.440
Look at those doggies in the back.

13:27.520 --> 13:29.960
They haven't even fought
and are still roughed up.

13:30.200 --> 13:32.440
Every last one of them.

13:32.520 --> 13:35.320
Yet they don't seem reluctant to fight,

13:35.400 --> 13:38.040
and don't give a damn
about their own pain.

13:38.120 --> 13:41.280
That's not training. That's brainwashing.

13:41.360 --> 13:43.320
You seem to know
what you're talking about.

13:44.120 --> 13:46.280
I've got first-hand experience!

13:46.360 --> 13:49.960
The tale of wimpy little Harleen Quinzel
before she got liberated.

13:50.720 --> 13:54.000
Brainwashed, obedient animals...

13:54.080 --> 13:56.440
Another expendable group
of criminals like us.

13:57.480 --> 13:58.480
Sounds familiar.

14:00.640 --> 14:03.320
Let's go.
I've got an idea who their commander is.

14:03.400 --> 14:05.000
He'll listen to what I have to say.

14:05.080 --> 14:06.320
Oh? A friend of yours?

14:06.960 --> 14:09.320
Yeah. One of my homies from the slammer.

14:09.400 --> 14:12.080
I've saved his ass countless times
from getting harassed.

14:16.200 --> 14:20.480
A fortress like this should have
an escape route or two somewhere.

14:20.560 --> 14:22.080
Hmm. Good point.

14:22.160 --> 14:24.560
A poor set makes for a poor movie.

14:24.640 --> 14:25.920
Could you step back a bit?

14:26.000 --> 14:27.640
I want to try something.

14:30.960 --> 14:31.960
Wow!

14:32.560 --> 14:34.000
Hmm. Is that all?

14:34.080 --> 14:36.600
Can't you wreck the whole fort
to get things over with?

14:36.680 --> 14:39.480
No. This isn't my forte, you see.

14:39.560 --> 14:43.520
My original power only allows me
to change the shape of my body.

14:44.040 --> 14:46.800
-Huh?
-Haven't you felt it as well?

14:46.880 --> 14:48.800
Something mysterious
since coming to this world?

14:48.880 --> 14:53.520
It's as if there's some kind of
magic power flowing through me.

14:57.880 --> 15:00.600
Unfortunately, my new powers
don't seem too versatile.

15:00.680 --> 15:02.520
Probably there's not enough moisture here.

15:02.600 --> 15:03.600
Moisture?

15:03.680 --> 15:05.680
I'm Clayface.

15:05.760 --> 15:07.640
I can manipulate clay.

15:07.720 --> 15:10.200
Primarily, only the clay
that comprises my body.

15:11.760 --> 15:14.880
In this world, I seem capable of
controlling any type of clay.

15:14.960 --> 15:17.320
Jeez. Not sure if that's useful or not.

15:18.000 --> 15:20.440
Any good protagonist needs
an endearing flaw.

15:21.120 --> 15:24.440
Tom from "Tom and Jerry"
struggled with Spike the dog, right?

15:43.720 --> 15:44.800
Oh, no.

16:04.120 --> 16:07.000
I didn't think anyone in the Kingdom
could get past my guards.

16:07.080 --> 16:09.600
Just to be clear,
I'm not here to fight you.

16:09.680 --> 16:11.040
We're homies, after all.

16:12.760 --> 16:14.200
Ain't that right, Rat?

16:18.320 --> 16:20.320
-Yo!
-What?

16:20.840 --> 16:22.160
Surprised, huh?

16:22.240 --> 16:23.240
That makes two of us.

16:23.320 --> 16:25.360
I never thought
you'd be in this world, too.

16:26.440 --> 16:27.520
That's the guy?

16:27.600 --> 16:29.320
Yeah, he's Ratcatcher.

16:29.400 --> 16:31.440
One of my very few homies.

16:31.520 --> 16:32.520
Right, Rat?

16:33.600 --> 16:35.400
Why the hell are you here?!

16:36.320 --> 16:37.720
You frigging asshole!

16:39.840 --> 16:42.360
Hey, is it just me
or does this guy reek of sewage?

16:42.440 --> 16:45.520
What do you expect?
None of his friends are human!

16:47.320 --> 16:50.880
Schmucks like you won't understand
the greatness this guy is capable of.

16:51.760 --> 16:53.880
Let me eat in peace, would ya?

16:53.960 --> 16:55.360
Oh, Deadshot...

16:55.440 --> 16:57.120
W-we were just...

16:57.800 --> 17:01.120
Just what? It sure looks like
you're blowing off steam on him.

17:02.240 --> 17:04.880
Sure, he's a miserable rat bastard.

17:04.960 --> 17:07.640
But you guys can't do jack
without herding together, either.

17:07.720 --> 17:08.720
Ain't that right?

17:09.240 --> 17:12.400
He's a gloomy and introvert
who reeks of sewage.

17:12.480 --> 17:15.880
I bet his dick is like unsliced bologna,
and has no luck with the ladies.

17:15.960 --> 17:17.240
But so what?

17:17.320 --> 17:19.880
Are you superhumans
who can do whatever you want?

17:19.960 --> 17:22.480
Then why the hell are you eating slop
in this hellhole?!

17:23.040 --> 17:24.160
Get lost!

17:31.320 --> 17:32.520
Yo, Rat!

17:34.000 --> 17:35.000
What's this?

17:35.080 --> 17:37.480
It's cheese. Your fave, right?

17:37.560 --> 17:40.280
It was headed for trash,
but let's not sweat the small stuff!

17:41.440 --> 17:42.960
I'm cool with this instead.

17:43.680 --> 17:44.880
Yuck, tastes like sewer.

17:46.600 --> 17:49.480
Hey, Rat! There you are!
I've been looking for you.

17:49.560 --> 17:52.360
To avoid getting messed with,
you got to change your look.

17:52.600 --> 17:54.960
Intimidate them. Know what I mean?

17:55.040 --> 17:56.040
What?

17:57.000 --> 17:58.480
Show this one, dammit!

17:58.560 --> 18:00.120
-Huh?!
-Screw that!

18:00.200 --> 18:02.200
This is the only stuff
that Rat can get off on!

18:02.280 --> 18:05.800
He's a freak who's into wild shit, okay?
Give him a chance.

18:05.880 --> 18:08.240
Yuck! I ain't watching that shit!

18:09.080 --> 18:11.520
Wazzup, Rat! Right, Rat?

18:11.600 --> 18:13.280
Listen, Rat. Rat!

18:13.360 --> 18:14.560
Rat.

18:15.240 --> 18:18.880
It's your damn fault that I... I...!

18:20.320 --> 18:21.840
Why's he angry?

18:21.920 --> 18:23.480
You call yourself his "friend"?

18:23.920 --> 18:25.840
That'd never make it to broadcast
on a TV show.

18:25.920 --> 18:28.840
Assholes like you are the reason
why there's no peace in the world.

18:30.760 --> 18:32.640
Devour them all!

18:33.480 --> 18:35.640
Don't leave a single bone behind!

18:38.240 --> 18:40.800
Hey!
The rest of us never did anything to you!

18:40.880 --> 18:42.200
So I was right!

18:42.280 --> 18:44.200
What's the deal, Rat?

18:44.280 --> 18:47.920
As I recall, rats are the only critters
that you have power over!

18:59.280 --> 19:00.280
Wham!

19:05.160 --> 19:06.160
There's no end!

19:08.160 --> 19:09.400
We need to kill him!

19:13.080 --> 19:14.080
Tsk!

19:23.320 --> 19:25.440
It's your fault! Do something about it!

19:25.960 --> 19:27.600
I was just trying to be nice!

19:27.680 --> 19:29.600
Hey, Rat! What did I do wrong, man?

19:29.680 --> 19:31.680
Was it because of the DVD or something?!

19:32.640 --> 19:34.600
You bastard!

19:41.720 --> 19:43.120
Water flows downward.

19:43.640 --> 19:46.800
A fact that remains the same,
be it medieval times or the modern day.

19:47.480 --> 19:52.080
Due to water pressure, water tanks
are typically built in elevated locations.

19:55.160 --> 19:56.960
Like the ones here.

20:25.680 --> 20:26.680
That bitch!

20:28.040 --> 20:29.280
She's here, too?

20:38.320 --> 20:39.320
What's going on?

20:43.880 --> 20:45.960
We might have overdone it a little.

20:48.040 --> 20:50.600
What did you do?!
I told you stay out of this!

20:51.400 --> 20:53.240
With that fighting of yours?

20:53.320 --> 20:56.640
This fort originally belonged to
our Kingdom!

20:56.720 --> 20:58.440
Our plan was to take it back!

20:58.520 --> 21:01.600
Whatever! You got it back, didn'tcha?

21:01.680 --> 21:03.960
It'll be just fine
after some repairs and cleaning.

21:04.040 --> 21:05.640
I want take a bath!

21:05.720 --> 21:07.760
Maybe he wanted us
to get his hair back, too.

21:09.800 --> 21:12.200
They've driven the Imperial forces away!

21:12.280 --> 21:15.200
It seems your plan worked perfectly,
Your Majesty!

21:19.000 --> 21:21.520
I was right. They can help us.

21:23.520 --> 21:25.200
I'm only going to help you this once.

21:25.280 --> 21:27.520
You know how the Emperor feels
about failures.

21:27.600 --> 21:29.840
I know. It won't happen again.

21:29.920 --> 21:32.480
I'm going to make that bastard
and his friends suffer

21:32.720 --> 21:34.840
by showing them what I'm really made of!

23:03.000 --> 23:06.000
Subtitles: Radha Shiotani Case
plint.com
